    {
      "name": "宇树科技官网",
      "url": "https://www.unitree.com/cn/news",
      "lang": "zh",
      "type": "html",
      "maxAgeDays": 45,
      "official": true,
      "enabled": true,
      "parse": {
        "item": "<a href=\"(?P<url>/cn/news/\\d+)\"[^>]*>(?P<block>.*?)</a>",
        "title": "<p class=\"title\"[^>]*>(?P<title>[^<]+)</p>",
        "date": "<p class=\"date\"[^>]*>(?P<date>\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2})</p>"
      },
      "note": "官网新闻中心没有 RSS，按页面结构解析；改版时只改这里的三条正则"
    },
    {
      "name": "智元机器人官网",
      "url": "https://www.agibot.com/news",
      "lang": "en",
      "type": "html",
      "maxAgeDays": 45,
      "official": true,
      "enabled": true,
      "parse": {
        "item": "<a href=\"(?P<url>/article/[^\"]+)\" title=\"(?P<title>[^\"]+)\"[^>]*>(?P<block>.*?)</a>",
        "date": "class=\"time\">(?P<date>\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2})<"
      },
      "note": "智元官网只有英文版新闻页，无 RSS；中文报道由量子位/雷峰网/36氪等覆盖"
    },
